===Etymology 2===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|fr|résumé}}, past participle of {{m|fr|résumer||to summarize}}, from {{der|en|la|resumo|resūmere|to take back}}; compare {{m|en|resume}}.

====Alternative forms====
